         spawn 2.2-2.8 m from it, inside the 0.40-1.00 m band simple_nav_3d
         counts obstacles in, so every run in every arm began by driving around a
         mannequin. It is scene furniture from another world's demo; nothing in
         the experiment reads label 8, and it had already cost the target list a
         candidate (see targets_flatforest.yaml, which skips "Oak tree_19"
         partly because this model stood 0.12 m from that trunk). The other
